      "type": "quiz",
      "title": "三、阅读程序（2）：数组分组（判断题 1.5 分 ×3 + 单选题 3 分 ×3 = 13.5 分）",
      "order": 3,
      "content": {
        "type": "quiz",
        "codeBlock": {
          "language": "cpp",
          "title": "阅读程序（2）：数组分组",
          "description": "将排序去重后的数组按相邻元素差 ≤ k 进行分组，求最少分组数。ans[i] 表示前 i 个元素中满足极差 ≤ k 的最少分组数。",
          "startLine": 1,
          "lines": [
            "#include <algorithm>",
            "#include <cstdio>",
            "#include <cstring>",
            "#define ll long long",
            "using namespace std;",
            "int n, k;",
            "int a[200007];",
            "int ans[200007];",
            "int main() {",
            "    scanf(\"%d%d\", &n, &k);",
            "    for (int i = 1; i <= n; ++i) {",
            "        scanf(\"%d\", &a[i]);",
            "    }",
            "    std::sort(a + 1, a + n + 1);",
            "    n = std::unique(a + 1, a + n + 1) - a - 1;",
            "    for (int i = 1, j = 0; i <= n; ++i) {",
            "        for (; j < i && a[i] - a[j + 1] > k; ++j);",
            "        ans[i] = ans[j] + 1;",
